{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17550","headline":"享文恭太子庙乐章 · 许孟容","name":"享文恭太子庙乐章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"觞牢具品，管弦有节。\n祝道寅恭，神仪昭晰。\n桐珪早贵，象辂追设。\n罄达乐成，降歆丰洁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许孟容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}